# The repo-root .gitignore excludes *.sql / *.sql.gz to keep DB dumps and
# pg_dump backups (e.g. the Makefile `backup` target) out of version control.
#
# Migration + seed SQL under database/ is SOURCE, not a dump — the clean-room
# demo's whole value is its committed synthetic corpus. Re-include it here.
# (Child .gitignore negations override the parent's *.sql rule.)
!migrations/*.sql

# Keep ignoring compressed dumps / backups even under database/.
*.sql.gz
backup-*.sql
